Title: A git hook starts the after-merge runner on every move of main
Created: 2026-10-27
Author: reviewer
Closed: autoclosed — PR #1774

--- log ---
2026-10-27T13:17Z reviewer created
2026-10-27T14:06Z reviewer closed — autoclosed — PR #1774

--- body ---
## Context
Raid 2026-10-27: after ticket 1245 made the before-merge set cheap (no pytest), 15 PRs merged through
the raid's landing path (a hand-rolled land.sh, then scripts/raid_land.py) and NO after-merge run
started: no record on any main tip, no runner log, no lock. raid_land.py's docstring says step 9 is
the caller's; raid Phase 7 calls raid_land.py and does not start it either. Main went about 1h20
without a full-suite pass, which voids the "trust, verify, monitor" bargain of tracker 1226.

## Design (author, 2026-10-27)
A git hook owns step 9: the existing `hooks/reference-transaction` (main-update guard, ticket 1045)
already sees every committed move of `refs/heads/main`; on such a move it starts
`merge-gate.py run-after --ref main` detached (nohup, from the shared git dir), never blocking or
failing the ref update. The runner's flock dedupes concurrent triggers. Every landing path (raid_land,
the merge recipe by hand, sync-local-main.sh after a web-UI merge) is then covered without a caller
remembering it; skills cite the hook instead of carrying the snippet.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] On a committed update of refs/heads/main, the reference-transaction hook starts the after-merge
      runner detached; the ref update's latency and exit status are unaffected (test: the hook returns
      at once and the update succeeds even when the runner fails to start).
- [ ] A test lands a request on a temp gated repo through raid_land.py and finds an after-merge record
      (or a busy-lock note) on the new tip without any caller starting the runner; it fails on today's code.
- [ ] Merge step 9, raid Phase 7 and raid_land.py's docstring cite the hook; no snippet restatement remains.
- [ ] `main_sweep.py --after` (lair's audit) flags main tips older than N minutes with no after-merge
      record, so a silent gap is caught within a day.
- [ ] The harness gate passes.

## Relevant files
hooks/reference-transaction, scripts/raid_land.py, skills/raid/SKILL.md, skills/merge/SKILL.md, scripts/main_sweep.py, skills/lair/SKILL.md

